  "prefLabel": "Env-A 2907.12 Reporting in Electronic Format",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-A 2907.12 Reporting in Electronic Format.\n\n(a) The AAR for each affected source shall submit, in electronic format using EPA’s electronic data reporting (EDR) convention, emissions and operations information as specified in this part.\n\n(b) Emissions and operations information shall be submitted to the ETS administrator within 30 days of the end of any quarter in which the owner or operator is required to report.\n\nSource. #10002, eff 10-1-11 (from Env-A 2911.01); ss by #12995, eff 2-25-20",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-a2900.html"
